{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19861","headline":"君子勿郁郁士有谤毁者作诗以赠之 二 · 孟郊","name":"君子勿郁郁士有谤毁者作诗以赠之 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日往复不见，秋堂莫仍学。\n玄发不知白，晓入寒铜觉。\n爲林未离树，有玉犹在璞。\n谁把碧梧枝，刻作云门乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}